sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Watch app
    participant C as ResponseCache (disk)
    participant P as Proxy
    W->>C: read(url)
    C-->>W: last good document + ETag
    W-xP: GET screen (no network / timeout)
    Note over W: URLError caught
    W-->>W: Show cached document<br/>with "Offline: showing saved copy"
    Note over W,P: No cache at all → error view with "Try again"
